    "Nope, not really. This is a set of checklists and information that you can use while playing Dark Souls to make sure you don't miss an item, action, conversation, or boss. If you need playthroughs then you can click on the zone titles to read the wiki walkthrough.": "这是一组供游玩时对照使用的清单，帮助你避免错过物品、动作、对话和首领。如需更详细的流程说明，可点击区域标题查看对应的英文 Wiki 攻略。",
